      {
        "id": "tb-nand",
        "moduleId": "nand-nor",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "CMOS 与非门",
        "markdown": "54/74HC00 是四 2 输入与非门，内部集成 4 个 2 输入与非门，逻辑表达式为\n\n$$F=\\overline{AB}$$\n\n功能表表明：只有 $A=1$ 且 $B=1$ 时输出 $F=0$；只要有一个输入为 0，输出即为 1。\n\n| A | B | F |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | 1 | 0 |\n| 0 | × | 1 |\n| × | 0 | 1 |",
        "provenance": {
          "origin": "textbook",
          "representation": "paraphrase",
